### Usa a extensão "REST Client" do VS Code para testar estes pedidos

GET http://localhost:3000/tarefas

###
POST http://localhost:3000/tarefas
Content-Type: application/json

{ "titulo": "Estudar Express", "descricao": "Rotas e middleware" }

###
GET http://localhost:3000/tarefas?concluida=false&pesquisa=estudar

###
PUT http://localhost:3000/tarefas/COLOCA_AQUI_O_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{ "concluida": true }

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/tarefas/COLOCA_AQUI_O_ID
